<p><table height='22' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='0' width='100%'><tr><td width='500' align='center'><font face='verdana' color='#999999' size='1'><strong>[17-12, 2001]</strong></font></td></tr></table>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
<tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" face="verdana" size="1"><font style="font-weight:700"><A NAME="988745154"> Tank You Celestial!</font> - <A HREF="mailto:erik.lindham@europeiska.com">Paradoxclaw</A> - 13:30</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" size="2" face="verdana">
On the behalf of Nordiska Kompaniet I would like to thank Celestial guild for that awesome time we had in Dragon Necropolis this Sunday.<p>

Nordiska Kompaniet was supposed to hunt casual mobs in DN, then Celestial zoned in and we merged the raids.<br> We got lots of nice drops and I think/hope that everyone had a good time.<p>

As deaths were to a minimum, we were able to kill a lot of Chetari’s and we also killed Vilefang ( evil snake ) <br>who dropped a nice 9/18 dagger, along with some stats.<p>

Loots were great overall, but as we all know loot is not the main reason for a raid, having a good time is.<br> And that’s what we had, a hell of a time! <p>

This was, in my opinion, the most successful raid for this guild so far, since the new leadership. We were amazingly coordinated. <p>

I hope you all got to know a few Celestial people, I tried to mix the groups somewhat.<p>

I also hope to raid with these people more in the future, we worked very well together.<br>
<br>
</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr>
  <tr height="1" bgcolor="#333333">
    <td colspan="3"></td>
</tr></table><br>

<p><table height='22' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='0' width='100%'><tr><td width='500' align='center'><font face='verdana' color='#999999' size='1'><strong>[15-12, 2001]</strong></font></td></tr></table>
