<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" size="2" face="verdana">
Great job guys , Last night we killed severlous and lord bob<br>

Severilous didn't drop green scale ( but dropped some nice stuff:<br>
<img src="gallery/severlous.jpg" align=bottom><br>
- grats Gansacco on RBB<br>
- grats Arme on dragon bracer hero<br>
- grats Ambroise on max horn<p>

Lord Bob dropped nice hat and his axe<br>

- grats Yakov on frozen turban<br>
- grats Graydorm unspellable axe<br>
<br>
</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr>
