<p><table height='22' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='0' width='100%'><tr><td width='500' align='center'><font face='verdana' color='#999999' size='1'><strong>[Nov 29, 2001]</strong></font></td></tr></table>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
<tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" face="verdana" size="1"><font style="font-weight:700"><A NAME="988745154">Back to work.</font> - <A HREF="mailto:richard.wild@virgin.net">Zaba</A> - 12:30</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" size="2" face="verdana">
Thursday, November 29th.  We've had a busy couple of weeks since we reformed on AB, with a raid every day.  Highlights included:<br><p>Killing Cazic Thule with our friends from Northern Lights.
<img alt="Cazic Thule, Lord of Fear" height="225" src="http://www.gameznet.com/eq/ultra/pics/cazicthule1.jpg" width="300"><br>
<p>Congratulations:<br> 
Raeb on his new <a href="http://www.gameznet.com/eq/equipment/halooftheenglightened.html" target="New Window">Halo of the Enlightened</a>,<br>  
Strufis on his new <a href="http://www.gameznet.com/eq/equipment/cloakofthefearsome.html" target="New Window">Cloak of the Fearsome</a>,<br>
<br>Killing our old friend Trakanon<br>
<img alt="Trakanon" src="http://www.gameznet.com/eq/ultra/pics/trakanon1.jpg" border=0><br>
<p>Congratulations:<br> 
Strufis on his new <a href="http://www.gameznet.com/eq/equipment/cobaltbreastplate.html" target="New Window">Cobalt Breastplate</a>,<br>  
Daolin on her new <a href="http://www.gameznet.com/eq/equipment/tolansdarkwoodbreastplate.html" target="New Window">Tolans Darkwood Breastplate</a>,<br>
He was also kind enough to donate four of his teeth to the cause<br><p>
We had a successful trip to Chardok for Xeni's Enchanter epic piece and Clere's Cleric piece, we went to PoG and had some fun,
 loot included sk gloves to Yrgass twink,bard gloves to Ambroise,necro, arms to Drickmoon,wiz arms to Zamel and a Bard bp to Zaba which meant Singling Steel BP to Efren.  The BP 
 dropped off a named Tree called Fayl Everstrong.<br><p>  We had fun with the Dragons in West Wastes and farmed some nice Dragon Skin Armour.  Last weekend, we sat in West Wing of 
 ToV for a few hours and got some more armour drops.<br><p>
 NK is back on its feet now but is still recruiting L58+ members as we're not quite up to capacity yet. 
<br>
</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr>
  <tr height="1" bgcolor="#333333">
    <td colspan="3"></td>
</tr></table><br>

<p><table height='22' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='0' width='100%'><tr><td width='500' align='center'><font face='verdana' color='#999999' size='1'><strong>[Nov 14, 2001]</strong></font></td></tr></table>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
<tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" face="verdana" size="1"><font style="font-weight:700"><A NAME="988745154">NK moves server.</font> - <A HREF="mailto:richard.wild@virgin.net">Zaba</A> - 12:30</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" size="2" face="verdana">
Tuesday, November 14th. Nordiska Kompaniet have moved to the Antonius Bayle server.  Due to Verant technical difficulties, the guild will not be reformed until Monday the 19th of November.

After that we will be ready to rock'n'roll =)  Hope to see you all there.<p>

We are accepting membership applications from characters L58 and above, please post on the board <a href="http://pub47.ezboard.com/bnordiska" target="New Window">NK Forums</a><br>
</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr>
  <tr height="1" bgcolor="#333333">
    <td colspan="3"></td>
</tr></table><br>

<p><table height='22' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='0' width='100%'><tr><td width='500' align='center'><font face='verdana' color='#999999' size='1'><strong>[Octo 29, 2001]</strong></font></td></tr></table>

<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
<tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" face="verdana" size="1"><font style="font-weight:700"><A NAME="988745154">NK is back baby, NK is back.</font> - <A HREF="mailto:dennis@byran1och2.se">Freyi</A> - 14:33</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" size="2" face="verdana">
Sunday october 28th. Nordiska Kompaniet comeback day! After nearly a month<br>
of slumber we finally got moving again. And what a sunday it was.<br>
We started off killing 2 <a href="http://eqbeastiary.allakhazam.com/search.shtml?id=6060" target="New window">Lord Doljonijiarnimorinar</a>.<br>
After that it was time for Velketor himself.
<img src="http://www.nk.netg.se/images/velketor_the_sorcerer.jpg" border=0><br>
Boy what i fight it was, 10-12 people LD and among those the main tank<br>
and second tank + clerics.<br>
But we kept hitting him and in the end we had a total of 2 deaths and a very dead Velketor.<br><br>
After these 3 nice kills resulting in some decent items we headed to<br>
Dragon Necropolis to give this pile of dragon waste a try:<br>
<img src="http://www.nk.netg.se/images/zlandicar.jpg" border=0><br>
